---
description: When editing js/vue files, before saving, agent MUST lint the changed file or hunk with eslint and address all findings
globs: '**/*.{js,vue}'
alwaysApply: true
---

Before saving a js or vue file:

- The agent MUST run eslint on the entire file or just the changed hunk.
- eslint autofixes SHOULD be applied before save.
- If autofix is not possible, agent MUST notify about remaining issues and suggest manual fixes.
- If possible, agent SHOULD nudge the user to resolve outstanding eslint problems before final save.
